    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-3">
      How to Prevent Polymeric Sand Haze on New Pavers
    </h1>
    <p class="text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-6">
      Polymeric sand is formulated with advanced organic polymers and cementitious binders that activate upon contact with water. When applied properly, it locks joints rock-hard and eliminates ant hills and weeds. But if misted while microscopic polymer dust rests on the paver surface, it cures into a stubborn, cloudy white milky film known as <em>polymeric haze</em>.
    </p>

    <!-- Quick Stats Grid -->
